Description:
	Implemented direct-PCAN 0x500 bring-up for the real-VCU HIL.
	CarMaker is the SOURCE of pedals: this maneuver ramps then holds Gas, so
	the last transmitted CarMakerPedalDemand value is non-zero. A zero-hold
	proves no command path. Vehicle is a 4-motor BEV so TorqueVect.mdl's
	PT.Motor{,1,2,3}.{Trq,rotv} and PT.PwrSupply.HV1.Pwr quantities exist.
	Commit 61a9dd6 records direct PCAN 0x500 reaching Speedgoat with ownership
	in 80/80 samples during a live 14.49 to 20 percent ramp. That test did not
	include the real VCU or prove connector voltages, harness, or torque output.
